  <item>
    <title>EP12:北美留子看文化｜哲学博士背包客：南极划艇遇鲸鱼，尼泊尔焚尸庙悟生死</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686b8ec660f8f77d4043d379</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686b8ec660f8f77d4043d379</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 09:11:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong><br><span>哲学博士生Luna分享她的背包旅行蜕变：从云南独自徒步起步，到南极冰海划艇直面震撼冰山、帝企鹅与擦肩鲸鱼；在尼泊尔加德满都目睹河边火葬仪式，珠峰徒步高反被直升机救援时更直面登山死亡。她讲述世界尽头的奇景与人文冲击，独自旅行如何打破界限遇见多元人生，以及徒步挑战如何让她领悟《臣服实验》的真谛——拥抱生命之流，在意外中找到力量。跟随思考者的脚步，重新定义旅行与生命。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 南极冰山震撼：</span></strong><span> 橡皮艇近观巨型冰山，感受地球远古力量。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 追踪帝企鹅：</span></strong><span> 揭秘企鹅“生存之路”，邂逅罕见帝企鹅。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> Kayak遇鲸惊魂：</span></strong><span> 划小艇与鲸鱼近距离“共舞”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 尼泊尔焚尸庙：</span></strong><span> 目睹河边公开火葬，直面生死观冲击。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> 珠峰高反救援：</span></strong><span> 严重高反直升机撤离，机场直面登山死亡。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 香格里拉秘境：</span></strong><span> 初入阿布吉措“桃花源”，点燃徒步热爱。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 寺庙误登金顶：</span></strong><span> 迷路后豁然开朗，隐喻旅途顿悟。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">38:01</a> 《臣服实验》启示：</span></strong><span> 放弃控制，接受生命安排，旅行意外的哲学升华。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsN1ZnMieGmP_7K9pZh2Ghu50Bv8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJEXSKi-LCLq19CuiZixcU2T1lQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrZ6hSObUd4ihb-LqbCJUxY5y1FH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67551b3a082ec6f5f16b450d/luDeTlAlbk2Q-5WzOdZi29w-Oez5.m4a" length="46200446" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fim-OBQpVAtl-5fESxZyd-2YIPrQ.png"/>
