  <item>
    <title>EP11:特别节目｜爱丁堡冷门宝藏专业：科学传播申请全揭秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685432174abe6e29cb03348a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685432174abe6e29cb03348a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Jun 2025 16:18:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong><br><span>西交利物浦本科毕业生Lyra成功斩获爱丁堡大学「科学传播与公众参与」硕士Offer！在这期节目中，她坦诚分享：从最初被曼大“一周秒拒”、UCL语言班失之交臂，到Gap Year期间</span><strong><span>亲手重写文书、精准匹配爱丁堡医学院课程偏好</span></strong><span>的逆袭关键。深度剖析这个设在</span><strong><span>医学院下、融合理科知识</span></strong><span>的小众专业学什么、做什么（出版社科普编辑？研究所科学“翻译”？），揭秘爱丁堡</span><strong><span>“宁古塔”式高学业压力与惊人挂科率</span></strong><span>。Lyra还犀利吐槽“水硕”标签与文科生困境，畅谈欧洲旅行计划，并对比</span><strong><span>西浦“无围墙自由”与严苛挂科制度</span></strong><span>下的独特生存体验。无论是小众专业申请、文书避坑、应对高压学业，还是规划留学生活，她的经历都提供了极具参考性的真实样本。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 选专业动机：</span></strong><span> 跨学科偏好 (文转理)，受医疗策展实习启发。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 中介选择：</span></strong><span> 选“小中介”获惊喜Offer，优于大中介流水线。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> 申请挫折：</span></strong><span> 曼大“一周秒拒”，UCL语言要求未达。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 文书逆袭：</span></strong><span> 自改文书，</span><strong><span>强化小红书数据实习 &amp; 医疗策展经历</span></strong><span>，匹配爱丁堡(医学院/偏理)。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 惊喜录取：</span></strong><span> 获爱丁堡</span><strong><span>无条件Offer (免语言)</span></strong><span>，推测因高度匹配。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 学业预警：</span></strong><span> 专业</span><strong><span>高挂科率 (10中5挂)</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>全论文考核</span></strong><span>是挑战。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 小组真相：</span></strong><span> “划水”不分国籍，关键在个人责任心。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 就业方向：</span></strong><span> 例：学姐做</span><strong><span>科普图书编辑</span></strong><span>，桥接科学与公众。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 旅行期待：</span></strong><span> 计划游南法、冰岛 (电竞情怀)、米兰 (童年梦想)。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 反击争议：</span></strong><span> 直面“水硕”标签，分享</span><strong><span>HR更看重经历/学位本身</span></strong><span>；吐槽“文科生困境”。</span></li><span></span></ol>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67551b3a082ec6f5f16b450d/lv4KrBxpbhn1pD96-HLkc_JD8frc.m4a" length="57028548" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJc2aZkHbiDP87cnUDRSu3_Mm7s.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP10:欧洲留子看风景｜毕业旅行后劲比留学还大！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6842458679e285b9b87821c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6842458679e285b9b87821c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Jun 2025 01:35:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>本期邀请了留学英国的Jessica和Crystal，她们沉淀一年后，用真实对比揭开欧洲旅行滤镜：东欧大巴惊魂记、瑞士天价难吃芝士锅、尼斯治愈海景背后的松弛哲学。从布拉格广场的"许愿池谎言"到冰岛"微信故乡"奇遇，再到法国逃票心跳时刻——关于物价、文化冲击和归属感的留学生活复盘，带你感受记忆发酵后的旅行真相。</span></h3><span></span><h3><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h3><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a></span></strong><span> 布拉格广场根本没有许愿池！</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a></span></strong><span> 布达佩斯大巴上错车，路人肉身拦车救命</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a></span></strong><span> 尼斯沿海火车突现绝美海景暴击</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a></span></strong><span> 瑞士400元芝士锅臭到难以下咽</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a></span></strong><span> 冰岛成"微信故乡"，中国游客浓度超标</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a></span></strong><span> 伦敦地铁单程≈40元人民币</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a></span></strong><span> 求职后才懂：尼斯海景是精神乌托邦</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a></span></strong><span> 法国火车无人查票的逃票惊魂</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a></span></strong><span> 葡萄牙里斯本：百元帆船追夕阳的神仙体验</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FinfZTTrBj0zda8zeNS8B5YK-gb1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzD1lxI6HJXK_NT2-acammSTUb4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhSOTn84n76SAZXKjAWJ_8Je9f-H.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLqRaSUfvRNgy3YA1H4H17P2c2M.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDzd_TkhXPCKpU6AAMLggHw3GLf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkY65Cmnwf8rpc9mR2YwBdBYDfSy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhulbN-n-nIPmY7Ptowanr9RJdX4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmkY2rj8EdWpvaUAQbZbgDOxCP3H.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67551b3a082ec6f5f16b450d/lsTg81J-tzqGBDNJMoHKO3LQ1VaY.m4a" length="42709679" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTaoCq3-AK_cGhmLKPEcjMprit7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
