  <item>
    <title>EP7:欧洲留子看风景｜伦敦丢手机、高地追日落，异国友情比风景更戳心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6805ac34cdd692da159c7a1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6805ac34cdd692da159c7a1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Apr 2025 02:27:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客邀请两位英国留学生慧慧和若伊，分享她们在异国求学与旅行的独特经历。节目中，二人讲述了交换期间的学习生活感悟、结伴旅行的趣事，以及在伦敦手机被偷的惊险经历。她们尤其强调了在异国他乡建立真挚友谊的珍贵，通过深度交流与共同经历，从普通同学成长为彼此人生中重要的支持者。节目充满温情与幽默，展现了留学生在陌生环境中自我成长与情感联结的双重收获。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a></span></strong><span> 慧慧谈留学中的学习与心态成长。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a></span></strong><span> 若伊分享埃克塞特“爬坡上学”与生活感悟。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a></span></strong><span> 慧慧讲述与若伊友情的深度升华。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a></span></strong><span> 主持人提问“深度交流中的难忘话题”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a></span></strong><span> 南安普顿旅行故事：夕阳与慢节奏体验。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a></span></strong><span> 爱丁堡与苏格兰高地暴走追光之旅。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a></span></strong><span> 平安夜伦敦手机被偷的惊险经历。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a></span></strong><span> 慧慧反思“行动胜于言语”的友情力量。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>更多照片请搜索小红书、抖音、视频号“跟着留子看世界”</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNPQWal3qsa-wTysJNByOcwg5qk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpbipDT-78bBb1c0cWGRogvXQpL-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYEn6GTHr3S695MTo1_7Wdv50wB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-X2SAsKyLvmlgJJcsKLT9Yvp2K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📷 by若伊</span></p>]]></description>
