  <item>
    <title>EP6:欧洲留子看文化｜从欧洲“逃票族”到埃及骗局：异国奇遇背后的深刻人生哲思</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f628720decaeb094ea44fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f628720decaeb094ea44fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 08:06:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容中，主持人小Y与三位留学生嘉宾Tony、慧慧、Brandon畅聊意大利罗马的交换生活与欧洲、埃及的奇幻旅程。从罗马慵懒的课堂节奏到英国黑暗料理的“毒害”，从埃及热气球惊魂到骆驼小哥的“天价”小费，本期节目不仅揭秘留学生活的酸甜苦辣，更深入探讨不同国家的文化差异、社会观察与生活哲学。三位嘉宾以幽默犀利的视角，带听众感受世界的参差与旅行的意义，既有爆笑吐槽，也有深刻反思，带大家“云游”欧洲和中东。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a></span></strong><span> Brandon的跨学科课程：社会学与时尚课的“混搭”体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a></span></strong><span> Tony吐槽罗马“慵懒基因”：教授迟到20分钟、课堂随意取消</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a></span></strong><span> Brandon的“疯狂旅行模式”：周中跨国游、周末回罗马洗衣服</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a></span></strong><span> 罗马“裸体”争议：博物馆满是人形雕塑，艺术审美成谜</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a></span></strong><span> 饮食文化大碰撞：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a></span></strong><span> Tony控诉意大利缺绿叶菜，披萨“只有芝士和咸味”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a></span></strong><span> 慧慧自曝英国速食中毒事件：火鸡面吃到半夜呕吐</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a></span></strong><span> Brandon的土豆中毒：发芽土豆引发小红书“集体共鸣”</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a></span></strong><span> 跨国友情名场面：Tony和Brandon赴英“拯救”慧慧的胃，却遭遇厨房物资荒</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a></span></strong><span> 英国地铁惊魂：深夜赶飞机遇铁路故障，险些误机</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a></span></strong><span> 欧洲逃票奇闻：意大利公交查票员“形同虚设”，英国闸机靠自觉</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1717">28:37</a></span></strong><span> Brandon的“穷游攻略”：小红书深度用户，旅行计划从焦虑到摆烂</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a></span></strong><span> 埃及奇幻冒险：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2323">38:43</a></span></strong><span> 热气球事故传闻：死亡率100%的“要命体验”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a></span></strong><span> 卢克索“乞讨小孩”事件：善意反被勒索，慧慧掏钱引争议</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a></span></strong><span> 沙漠骆驼惊魂：小哥索要天价小费，警察持枪“调解”</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3368">56:08</a></span></strong><span> 慧慧谈“时间定律”：不同国家处于“社会进化时间表”的不同阶</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a></span></strong><span> Tony反思物欲落差：埃及农村的淳朴生活 vs 留学生的“消费焦虑”</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3831">01:03:51</a></span></strong><span> Brandon的“此生无悔入华夏”：国外生活便利性落差与文化归属感</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4169">01:09:29</a></span></strong><span> 润学争议：欧洲“穷开心” vs 国内“先苦后甜”的价值观碰撞</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4481">01:14:41</a></span></strong><span> 快问快答：最爱城市提名&amp;最坑景点吐槽&amp;穿越建议</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>更多视觉精彩请搜索小红书、抖音、视频号“跟着留子看世界”</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnfyu4NjmPxGlmFmiCfmctur8AtQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFmPOven5zNiaImQDElEGWCUtTL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXAi0O4vRaXNCPIQms2cp9SZS2M.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFPqmPniwyEYcK4xITESdawGPsX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📷by Tony、Brandon、慧慧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67551b3a082ec6f5f16b450d/lpB1JO5eLB0tCF2kQIXTZavDbcL2.m4a" length="79410891" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0f42dbAEgGTudjUpwj7jMQaM4e.png"/>
