  <item>
    <title>EP2:北美留子看文化｜关于灾难、艺术、自然......在博物馆里，我们看见了什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6787b61ff787119b3d750b8b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6787b61ff787119b3d750b8b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本场嘉宾是USC留学生 🍠@等登灯邓 @一枝豆子，他们趁着圣诞假，来到了美东，游览了波士顿美术馆、911纪念馆、纽约现代艺术博物馆（MOMA）、大都会博物馆等等博物馆，领略了美国的历史与文化。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> &nbsp;美国火车体验引发🍠网友热议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 不尽如人意的波士顿美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 体验不好但触动很深的911纪念馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 买展览门票的省钱方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 体验很好的纽约现代艺术博物馆（MOMA）和大都会博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> 博物馆沉浸式体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 排名第二的芝加哥艺术博物馆：教育的闭环在此刻体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3612">60:12</a> “伟大”的间谍博物馆：沉浸互动式体验历史</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luiApIreOWReMuMhNTzdnQXLVn_e.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsBk4ll18jPgnZfgCH6OFQXz8lTC.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk7NeDtlmj-QHayUy_8g34jZ2YzD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FudICIn6SY9YED9M53vucsZwoA0X.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz_pS6pSUBA63gQ3I4yuzih4Kv2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2fpvIxBUn7Lo6iKJX0XHXExQTb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片来自🍠@等登灯邓 @一枝豆子，请勿盗用</span></p>]]></description>
